# Links: `device open-url` hands a URL to the app as a tapped deep link would. `tinyapp://items/<id>` opens that
# item on top of whatever is shown; a link to an item the list does not have reports notFound, as `open` does.
device open-url tinyapp://items/2
expect screen=items/2 title="Second item"
back
device open-url tinyapp://items/9
expect screen=items error=notFound
device open-url tinyapp://items/3
expect screen=items/3 title="Third item" error=none
